\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Away with gloom, away with doubt!
\par With all the morning stars we sing;
\par With all the sons of God we shout
\par The praises of a King,
\par            Alleluia!
\par Of our returning King!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Away with death, and welcome life;
\par In Him we died and live again;
\par And welcome peace, away with strife,
\par For He returns to reign.
\par           Alleluia!
\par The Crucified shall reign.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Then welcome beauty, He is fair;
\par And welcome youth, for He is young;
\par And welcome spring; and everywhere
\par Let merry songs be sung!
\par              Alleluia!
\par For such a King be sung!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

